msgstr ""
"Krita je prevedena v slovenščino (kar potrjuje tudi prevod tega odgovora). "
"Krita samodejno uporablja sistemski jezik. Če to ni tako, sledite tem "
"korakom:"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:52
msgid ""
"With :menuselection:`Settings --> Switch Application Language...` menu item "
"will appear a small window."
msgstr ""
"Z menijskim ukazom :menuselection:`Nastavitve --> Preklopi jezik programa …` "
"se prikaže majhno okno."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:53
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Primary language` and select your language."
msgstr "Kliknite :guilabel:`Primarni jezik` in izberite svoj želeni jezik."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:54
msgid "Click :guilabel:`OK` to close the window."
msgstr "Kliknite :guilabel:`V redu`, da zaprete okno."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:55
msgid "Restart krita, and it will be displayed in your selected language!"
msgstr "Ponovno zaženite Krito in odprla se bo v izbranem jeziku!"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:57
msgid ""
"If this doesn't work, you might have to add a fall-back language as well. "
"This is a bug, but we haven't found the solution yet."
msgstr ""
"Če to ne bo delovalo, boste morda morali dodati tudi nadomestni jezik. To je "
"hrošč, vendar rešitve še nismo našli."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:60
msgid "I have a problem, how to get support for Krita?"
msgstr "Imam problem, kako pridem do podpore za Krito?"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:62
msgid "Ask your question on `Krita Artists <https://krita-artists.org/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Zastavite svoje vprašanje na forumu `Krita Artists <https://krita-artists."
"org/>`_."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:64
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Remember -- most probably the person you're interacting with is a volunteer, "
"and even if not, it's not someone actually paid for doing user support. "
"Treat them nicely and respect their time! They will for sure reciprocate "
"that."
msgstr ""
"Ne pozabite -- najverjetneje je oseba, s katero sodelujete, prostovoljec, in "
"tudi če ne, to ni nekdo, ki je dejansko plačal za delo uporabniške podpore. "
"Lepo ravnajte z njimi in spoštujte njihov čas! To bodo zagotovo vzajemno "
"ujemale."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:66
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Create a new thread or post for your issue and state the issue in the title. "
"Even if you don't know how to describe it exactly, for example you title the "
"post \"Krita's text tool is acting weird\", it is much better than simple "
"\"Help!\"."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarite novo nit ali objavo za težavo in navejte težavo v naslovu. Tudi če "
"tega ne veste natančno opisati, na primer naslovite objavo \"Kritino "
"besedilno orodje se čudno obnaša\", je veliko bolje kot preprosto \"Pomoč!\"."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:68
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Describe your issue. You can add screenshots and videos, but even if you do "
"that, write a few words what the video shows and what the issue is."
msgstr ""
"Opišite težavo. Lahko dodate posnetke zaslona in videoposnetke, vendar tudi "
"če to storite, napišite nekaj besed, kaj video prikazuje in kaj je težava."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:70
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"State all relevant details: most importantly your operating system (Windows, "
"macOS, Linux...), which version of Krita you use (go to :menuselection:`Help "
"--> About Krita` to find out) and what kind of tablet you have (if your "
"issue is related to a tablet driver)."
msgstr ""
"Navedite vse ustrezne podrobnosti: najpomembnejše je, da vaš operacijski "
"sistem (Windows, macOS, Linux...), katero različico Krita uporabljate "
"(pojdite na :menuselection:'Pomoč --> O Kriti' da izveste) in kakšno tablico "
"imate (če je vaša težava povezana z gonilnikom tabličnega računalnika)."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:72
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Answer all questions your supporter asks, even if you don't think they're "
"relevant. They probably have a reason to ask about that."
msgstr ""
"Odgovorite na vsa vprašanja, ki jih zastavlja vaš podpornik, tudi če "
"mislite, da niso relevantna. Verjetno imajo razlog, da vprašajo o tem."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:74
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you don't know the answer, or you don't know how to get the information "
"your supporter asks for, don't hesitate to ask for clarification."
msgstr ""
"Če odgovora ne poznate ali ne veste, kako priti do informacij, ki jih "
"zahteva vaš podpiralec, ne oklevajte, da prosite za pojasnilo."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:76
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you mentioned an issue, please help with testing if you're asked to do "
"that -- that will speed up the process of finding the cause and preparing a "
"fix."
msgstr ""
"Če ste omenili težavo, prosimo, pomagajte pri testiranju, če boste to "
"zahtevali -- to bo pospešilo postopek iskanja vzroka in priprave popravka."

