#, fuzzy
msgid "Causes for this could be the following:"
msgstr "Vzroki za to so lahko naslednji:"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:167
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It might be that your download got corrupted and is missing files (common "
"with bad Wi-Fi and bad internet connection in general), in that case, try to "
"find a better internet connection before trying to download again. Krita "
"should be around 80 to 100 MB in size when downloading."
msgstr ""
"Morda je vaš prenos poškodovan in manjka datoteke (skupno s slabo Wi-Fi in "
"slabo internetno povezavo na splošno), v tem primeru poskusite najti boljšo "
"internetno povezavo, preden poskusite znova prenesti. Krita mora biti pri "
"prenosu okrog 80 do 100 MB velikosti."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:168
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It might be that something went wrong during installation. Check whether "
"your hard drive is full and reinstall Krita with at least 120 MB of empty "
"space. If not, and the problem still occurs, there might be something odd "
"going on with your device, and it's recommended to find a computer expert to "
"diagnose what is the problem."
msgstr ""
"Morda je šlo nekaj narobe med namestitvijo. Preverite, ali je trdi disk poln "
"in znova namestite Krita z vsaj 120 MB praznega prostora. Če ne, in se "
"težava še vedno pojavi, se morda nekaj čudnega dogaja z vašo napravo in "
"priporočljivo je najti računalniškega strokovnjaka za diagnosticiranje, v "
"čem je težava."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:169
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some unzip programs don't unpack our ZIP files correctly. The native ones on "
"Windows, macOS and most Linux distributions should be just fine, and we "
"recommend using them."
msgstr ""
"Nekateri programi ne razpakiranje naše ZIP datoteke pravilno. Domorodci na "
"Windows, macOS in večini Linux distribucij bi morali biti prav v redu, in "
"priporočamo uporabo."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:170
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You manually, using a file manager deleted or moved resources around, and "
"thus Krita cannot find them anymore."
msgstr ""
"Ročno uporabljate upravitelja datotek, ki je izbrisal ali premaknil vire "
"naokoli, zato jih Krita ne more več najti."

