"standardnega pristopa. V operacijskem sistemu Windows to pomeni, da greste v "
"meni Start in izberete »Shutdown«."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:278
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Badly programmed security software may attempt to rewrite KRA files, or "
"prevent Krita from writing to the folder you wish to save to. These cases "
"can be checked by trying to save in that location, and then, without "
"shutting down Krita, checking in the folder to see if the file saved. Files "
"lost due this cannot be recovered."
msgstr ""
"Slabo programska varnostna programska oprema lahko poskusi znova napisati "
"KRA datoteke ali preprečiti Krita pisanje v mapo, ki jo želite shraniti. Te "
"primere je mogoče preveriti tako, da poskusite shraniti na tem mestu, in "
"nato, brez zaustavitve Krita, preverjanje v mapi, da bi videli, ali je "
"datoteka shranjena. Datotek, izgubljenih zaradi tega, ni mogoče obnoviti."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:279
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Cloud services like Dropbox and OneDrive have been known to prevent Krita "
