"Datotek, izgubljenih zaradi tega, ni mogoče obnoviti."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:280
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Occasionally the ZIP files that KRA files consist of will have the last few "
"bytes missing. We're doing everything in our power to prevent this kind of "
