"for you, you can try to recover the previous save using methods that checks "
"the hard drive directly."
msgstr ""
"Odprite datoteko v beležnici ali drugem urejevalniku besedil. Če je vsebina "
"datoteke samo ponavljajoči se simbol *NULL*, to pomeni, da je datoteka "
"najverjetneje nepremočljiva z uporabo standardne metode. Če je zelo pomembno "
"za vas, lahko poskusite obnoviti prejšnje shranjevanje z metodami, ki "
"neposredno preverja trdi disk."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:319
#, fuzzy
msgid "Krita crashes on Windows 7 on start-up"
msgstr "Krita se zruši v sistemu Windows 7 ob zagonu"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:321
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Starting with Krita 4.2.0, Krita uses version 5.12 of the Qt toolkit. This "
"needs to have access to Direct3D 11 or OpenGL ES 2.0 or higher. You might "
"need to install drivers appropriate to your GPU (Nvidia, AMD/ATI, Intel). "
"This also makes it hard to run Krita in a virtual environment: in Virtual "
"Box you need to install the guest addition in safe mode, and enable the "
"experimental Direct3D support."
msgstr ""
"Krita začenša s krito 4.2.0 uporablja različico 5.12 orodja Qt. To mora "
"imeti dostop do direktive Direct3D 11 ali OpenGL ES 2.0 ali višje. Morda "
"boste morali namestiti gonilnike, ki ustrezajo vašemu GPU (Nvidia, AMD/ATI, "
"Intel). To prav tako oteži zagon Krita v virtualnem okolju: v Virtual Box "
"morate namestiti gost dodatek v varnem načinu, in omogočiti eksperimentalno "
"Direct3D podporo."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:325
#, fuzzy
msgid "Krita freezes randomly on my Windows system"
msgstr "Krita zamrzne naključno na mojem sistemu Windows"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:327
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Are you using a dictionary app (e.g. Youdao Dictionary for Chinese users)? "
"Some dictionary apps can read words from other app's windows and show popup "
"translations in real time. However, it has been reported that such apps tend "
"to cause Krita to freeze randomly. If you are using one of those, make sure "
"to QUIT them (no notification icon) when using Krita. Some of those apps "
"keep running in the background even after being closed. In such case, you "
"will have to uninstall them."
msgstr ""
"Uporabljate aplikacijo za slovar (npr. Youdao Slovar za kitajske "
"uporabnike)? Nekatere aplikacije za slovar lahko berejo besede iz oken druge "
"aplikacije in v realnem času prikažejo popup prevode. Vendar je bilo "
"sporočene, da takšne aplikacije običajno povzročijo, da krita naključno "
"zamrzne. Če uporabljate eno od teh, jih pri uporabi zdravila Krita izklopite "
"(brez ikone obvestila). Nekatere od teh aplikacij se še naprej izvajajo v "
"ozadju tudi po zaprtju. V takem primeru jih boste morali odstraniti."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:331
#, fuzzy
msgid "Windows: How can I produce a backtrace?"
msgstr "Windows: Kako lahko ustvarim backtrace?"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:335
#, fuzzy
msgid ":ref:`Dr. Mingw debugger <dr_minw>`"
msgstr ":ref:'Dr. Mingw debugger <dr_minw>'"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:337
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you experience a crash on Windows, and can reproduce the crash, the bug "
"report will be much more valuable if you can create a backtrace. A backtrace "
"is somewhat akin to an airplane's black box, in that they tell what set of "
"instructions your computer was running when it was crashing (where the crash "
"happened), making it very useful to figure out why the crash happened."
msgstr ""
"Če pride do strmoglavljenje v sistemu Windows in lahko reproducirate "
"strmoglavljenje, bo poročilo o napakah veliko bolj dragoceno, če lahko "
"ustvarite backtrace. Backtrace je nekoliko podobne črna škatla letala, v "
"tem, da povejo, kateri nabor navodil vaš računalnik je bil zagnan, ko je "
"strmoglavil (kjer se je nesreča zgodila), zaradi česar je zelo koristno "
"ugotoviti, zakaj se je nesreča zgodila."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:339
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Dr. Mingw debugger <dr_minw>` is bundled with Krita. Please visit "
"the page :ref:`Dr. Mingw debugger <dr_minw>` for instructions on getting a "
"backtrace with it."
msgstr ""
"The :ref:'Dr. Mingw debugger ' je v paketu <dr_minw>s Krito. Prosimo, "
"obiščite stran :ref:'Dr. Mingw debugger ' za navodila o pridobivanju "
"<dr_minw>backtrace z njim."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:342
#, fuzzy
msgid "Windows: Krita's window is semi-transparent"
msgstr "Windows: Kritino okno je pol pregledno"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:344
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Chances are you are using an NVIDIA GPU. Due to a bug in NVIDIA's driver "
"that we haven't been able to work around yet, sometimes Krita's window will "
"be transparent or semi-transparent. The solution is to enable the Angle "
"renderer in Krita's Settings dialog. Open the :menuselection:`Settings` menu "
"(Press Alt-N if the menubar is not visible and your system is in English), "
"then open the :guilabel:`Configure Krita` dialog. In the dialog window "
"select the :guilabel:`Display` page and select the Angle renderer in the :"
"guilabel:`Preferred Renderer` drop down. Restart Krita."
msgstr ""
"Verjetno uporabljate NVIDIA GPU. Zaradi hrošča v NVIDIA-inem vozniku, ki ga "
"še nismo mogli delati, bo kritino okno včasih pregledno ali pol pregledno. "
"Rešitev je omogočiti kotni ugasnik v Kritinem pogovornem oknu Nastavitve. "
"Odprite meni :menuselection:'Settings' (Pritisnite Alt-N, če menijna vrstica "
"ni vidna in je vaš sistem v angleščini), nato odprite pogovorno okno :"
"guilabel:'Konfiguriraj Krita'. V pogovornem oknu izberite stran :"
"guilabel:'Display' in v spustnem meniju :guilabel:'Preferred Renderer' "
"izberite kotni ugasnik. Znova zaženi Krito."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:347
#, fuzzy
msgid "Why are there ampersand (&) characters in some docker titles?"
msgstr "Zakaj so v nekaterih naslovih dockerja ampersand (&) znaki?"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:349
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is a bug in one of the third party libraries Krita uses (and "
"consequently has no direct influence over), where letters that should "
"actually be underlined (they point out keyboard shortcuts that can be used "
"when the :menuselection:`Settings --> Docker` menu is open) are instead "
"prepended with an ampersand (&)."
msgstr ""
"To je hrošč v eni od knjižnic tretjih oseb, ki jo Krita uporablja (in "
"posledično nima neposrednega vpliva na), kjer so črke, ki jih je treba "
"dejansko podčrtati (poudarjajo bližnjice na tipkovnici, ki jih je mogoče "
"uporabiti, ko je odprt :menuselection:'Nastavitve --> Dockerjev meni) so "
"namesto tega pripravljene z ampersand (&)."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:355
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This bug only occurs with specific system configurations (it's related to "
"the \"Fusion\" style) and/or in Krita packages obtained from third parties "
"(e.g. in some Linux distributions)."
msgstr ""
"Ta hrošč se pojavi samo s posebnimi konfiguracijami sistema (povezano je s "
"slogom »Fusion« in/ali v Krita paketih, pridobljenih od tretjih oseb (npr. v "
"nekaterih Distribucijah Linuxa)."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:358
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you are on Linux the best way to resolve this is to use an official "
"package from `krita.org <https://krita.org>`_, such as the AppImage, Snap/"
"Flatpak or PPA releases that are officially provided on the `download page "
"<https://krita.org/download/krita-desktop/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Če ste v Linuxu, je najboljši način za rešitev tega, da uporabite uradni "
"paket iz »krita.org <https://krita.org>«_, kot so izdaje AppImage, Snap/"
"Flatpak ali PPA, ki so uradno na voljo na strani za prenos <https://krita."
"org/download/krita-desktop/>'_."

