#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:547
msgid "Who and what is Kiki?"
msgstr "Kdo in kaj je Kiki?"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:549
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Kiki is a cyber squirrel. She’s our mascot and has been designed by Tyson "
"Tan. We choose a squirrel when we discovered that ‘krita’ is the Albanian "
"word for Squirrel."
msgstr ""
"Kiki je kibernetska veverica. Ona je naša maskota in jo je oblikoval Tyson "
"Tan. Izbrali smo veverico, ko smo odkrili, da je \"krita\" albanska beseda "
"za Veverico."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:552
msgid "Why is Krita Free?"
msgstr "Zakaj je Krita brezplačna?"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:554
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Krita is developed as `free software <https://www.gnu.org/>`_ within the KDE "
"community. We believe that good tools should be available for all artists. "
"You can also buy Krita on the Windows Store if you want to support Krita's "
"development or want to have automatic updates to newer versions."
msgstr ""
"Krita je razvita kot \"brezplačna programska oprema <https://www.gnu.org/>"
"\"_ znotraj KDE skupnosti. Menimo, da bi morala biti dobra orodja na voljo "
"za vse umetnike. Krito lahko kupite tudi v Trgovini Windows, če želite "
"podpreti Kritin razvoj ali pa želite imeti samodejne posodobitve novejših "
"različic."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:557
#, fuzzy
msgid "Why isn't Krita on Steam and in the Windows Store Free?"
msgstr "Zakaj Krita ni na pari in v Trgovini Windows Free?"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:559
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Krita on Steam and in the Windows Store is still Free and Open Source "
"software; the binaries are exactly the ones you can also download from krita."
"org. We've put a price tag on downloading Krita from either store to support "
"Krita's development. Nobody is getting rich out of it, but the income from "
"Steam and the Windows Store currently pays for the full-time involvement "
"with Krita of four developers. See `Krita Available from the Windows Store "
"<https://krita.org/en/item/krita-available-from-the-windows-store/>`_ for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"Krita na Pari in v Trgovini Windows je še vedno brezplačna in odprtokodna "
"programska oprema; binaries so točno tisti, ki jih lahko prenesete tudi iz "
"krita.org. Dali smo ceno za prenos Krite iz obeh trgovin, da bi podprli "
"Kritin razvoj. Nihče se ne bogati iz tega, vendar prihodki od Steam in "
"Windows Store trenutno plačujejo za polno sodelovanje s Krito štirih "
"razvijalcev. Če želite več informacij, glejte »Krita na voljo v trgovini "
"Windows <https://krita.org/en/item/krita-available-from-the-windows-store/"
">_«."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:563
#, fuzzy
msgid "Can I use Krita commercially?"
msgstr "Lahko uporabim Krito komercialno?"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:565
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Yes. What you create with Krita is your sole property. You own your work and "
"can license your art however you want. Krita’s GPL license applies to "
"Krita’s source code. Krita can be used commercially by artists for any "
"purpose, by studios to make concept art, textures, or VFX, by game artists "
"to work on commercial games, by scientists for research, and by students in "
"educational institutions."
msgstr ""
"Da. To, kar ustvarite s Krito, je vaša last. Svoje delo si lastiš in lahko "
"licenciš svojo umetnost, če hočeš. Kritina licenca za GPL velja za Kritino "
"izvorno kodo. Krita lahko umetniki komercialno uporabljajo za vsak namen, "
"studii za oblikovanje konceptne umetnosti, teksture ali VFX, s strani "
"umetnikov iger za delo na komercialnih igrah, znanstveniki za raziskave, in "
"študenti v izobraževalnih ustanovah."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:567
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You can also make videos or stream your desktop with Krita's interface "
"visible (which can be used to make art tutorials or time lapses)."
msgstr ""
"Videoposnetke ali pretakanje namizja lahko naredite vidnim tudi s Kritinim "
"vmesnikom (s katerim lahko naredite umetniške vaje ali časovne zamike)."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:569
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you modify Krita itself, and distribute the result, you have to share "
"your modifications with us. Krita’s GNU GPL license guarantees you this "
"freedom. Nobody is ever permitted to take it away."
msgstr ""
"Če spremenite krito in porazdelite rezultat, morate svoje spremembe deliti z "
"nami. Kritina licenca GNU GPL vam zagotavlja to svobodo. Nikomur ni "
"dovoljeno, da ga odpelje."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:575
msgid "Can I get Krita for iPad or for Android?"
msgstr "Ali lahko dobim Krito za iPad ali za Android?"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:577
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Not for iOS or iPadOS at this point in time: there are `problems in any case "
"with putting an application licensed under the GNU Public License V3 in the "
"iOS App Store <https://www.fsf.org/news/2010-05-app-store-compliance>`_. "
"Krita for Android is currently in beta `in the Google Play Store <https://"
"play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.krita>`_ F-Droid is coming."
msgstr ""
"Ne za iOS ali iPadOS v tem trenutku: obstajajo \"težave v vsakem primeru z "
"dajanjem aplikacije, licencirano pod GNU Javno licenco V3 v iOS App Store "
"<https://www.fsf.org/news/2010-05-app-store-compliance>'_. Krita za Android "
"je trenutno v beta 'v Trgovini Google Play <https://play.google.com/store/"
"apps/details?id=org.krita>'_ F-Droid prihaja."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:580
msgid "Who translates Krita"
msgstr "Kdo prevaja Krito"

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:582
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Krita is a `KDE application <https://www.kde.org/>`_ — and proud of it! That "
"means that Krita’s translations are done by `KDE localization teams <https://"
"l10n.kde.org/>`_. If you want to help out, join the team for your language! "
"There is another way you can help out making Krita look good in any "
"language, and that is join the development team and fix issues within the "
"code that make Krita harder to translate."
msgstr ""
"Krita je \"KDE aplikacija <https://www.kde.org/>\"_ – in ponosna nanjo! To "
"pomeni, da Kritine prevode opravijo 'KDE lokalizacijske ekipe <https://l10n."
"kde.org/>'_. Če želite pomagati, se pridružite ekipi za svoj jezik! Obstaja "
"še en način, da pomagate, da Krita izgleda dobro v katerem koli jeziku, in "
"to je pridružite razvojni ekipi in odpravite vprašanja znotraj kode, ki "
"krita težje prevesti."

#: ../../KritaFAQ.rst:584
msgid ""
"Please refer to https://community.kde.org/Get_Involved/translation for more "
"general instructions on getting involved in KDE localization."
msgstr ""
"Oglejte si https://community.kde.org/Get_Involved/translation za več "
"splošnih navodil, kako sodelujete pri lokalizaciji KDE."

